{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1493601-purview-table","id":1493601,"title":"Purview Table","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-23T14:36:36-07:00","id":1493601,"title":"Purview Table","content":"Hello all! I'm currently working on a spreadsheet which will list all gods associated with a given Purview in each Pantheon. I wanted to make something that could be used as an easy reference chart for character creation, since I sometimes find trying to select a given God to obtain a given Purview to be a boring and mind-numbing. Hence this work. Obviously, there is a LOT of work to be done here, with only Artistry being complete, but the hope is that by the end of it all, I'll have listed every God in every Pantheon, though currently there are 3 exceptions:<br /> <br /> 1. The Teros, as they are more of an example for homebrew than a traditional Pantheon. That's not me insulting them, I just want to save them for later and focus on the more &quot;traditional&quot; gods.<br /> 2. The Mythos Pantheon, since we don't have the final draft of the Mythos Book yet with all of the errata.<br /> 3. The Titans from Titanomachy, because they aren't gods. They'll be added... eventually.<br /> <br /> In any case, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1LB3EEFYTSmlB1Kso1d-ZABIv3PoI5Pm7nLqlBDsbYHg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a> is the link.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-30T04:33:18-07:00","id":1494033,"title":"","content":"It seems easier to just pick the god you wan